    },
    {
      "key": "t02a4bc252ca19e7b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">During quieter trading sessions</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Durante sesiones comerciales más tranquilas</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td9ce28ab8b860ea5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is one reason </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">slippage in forex</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> may become more noticeable during highly volatile periods.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Esta es una de las razones por las que </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">el deslizamiento en Forex</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> puede volverse más notorio durante períodos altamente volátiles.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7e7c7db952481bd1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Order Size Relative to Liquidity</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Tamaño de la orden en relación con la liquidez</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t564d75e557ada3a1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The route between a trader's platform, the broker's infrastructure, and available execution venues can also influence the time between order submission and execution.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">La ruta entre la plataforma de un operador, la infraestructura del corredor y los lugares de ejecución disponibles también pueden influir en el tiempo entre el envío y la ejecución de la orden.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tef1b07454f929663",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Understanding this difference is important because managing slippage often involves choosing between execution certainty and price control.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Comprender esta diferencia es importante porque gestionar el deslizamiento a menudo implica elegir entre certeza de ejecución y control de precios.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "taa0458771b7c9ee5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Positive Slippage vs Negative Slippage: What's the Difference?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Deslizamiento positivo versus deslizamiento negativo: ¿cuál es la diferencia?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t467bf38c9b2c5f8c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Positive slippage means an order executes at a price more favorable than expected. Negative slippage means the execution price is less favorable.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Deslizamiento positivo significa que una orden se ejecuta a un precio más favorable de lo esperado. Un deslizamiento negativo significa que el precio de ejecución es menos favorable.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t47d0a9cefffe82a2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lower execution price = positive slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Precio de ejecución más bajo = deslizamiento positivo</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tab623a2858d39f10",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Higher execution price = negative slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Precio de ejecución más alto = deslizamiento negativo</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8c2ac3988d0d79d8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Higher execution price = positive slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Precio de ejecución más alto = deslizamiento positivo</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "taf9db31677145e6a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Lower execution price = negative slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Precio de ejecución más bajo = deslizamiento negativo</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf66b10a3425f669d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage direction is therefore determined by both the market movement and the direction of the order.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Por lo tanto, la dirección del deslizamiento está determinada tanto por el movimiento del mercado como por la dirección de la orden.</span>"
    },
