      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Diferencia de deslizamiento = Precio de ejecución - Precio esperado</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0979fa14f03d7298",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage can be expressed using price units such as pips or points depending on the instrument and platform conventions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">El deslizamiento se puede expresar utilizando unidades de precio como pips o puntos, según las convenciones del instrumento y la plataforma.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0557c6951301a9df",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">MetaQuotes distinguishes between execution modes such as:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">MetaQuotes distingue entre modos de ejecución como:</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t694104e44efd8014",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Instant Execution</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Ejecución instantánea</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td466f4ac28e1f1be",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Request Execution</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Solicitud de ejecución</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0ea9102611098c9e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Under Instant Execution, for example, a price movement beyond the accepted deviation may result in a requote rather than automatic execution at the changed price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Bajo la ejecución instantánea, por ejemplo, un movimiento de precio más allá de la desviación aceptada puede resultar en una recotización en lugar de una ejecución automática al precio modificado.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbe412a058d123075",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Traders should therefore understand the specific order and execution settings available through the</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">MetaTrader 5 trading platform</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\"> rather than assuming that one setting applies to every instrument.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Por lo tanto, los operadores deben comprender las configuraciones de orden y ejecución específicas disponibles a través de</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">MetaTrader 5 plataforma de operaciones</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\"> en lugar de asumir que una configuración se aplica a cada instrumento.</span>"
    },
