    {
      "key": "t67bccb832cd30bcd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Does the Execution Model Affect Slippage?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">¿Cómo afecta el modelo de ejecución al deslizamiento?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1978ad5624b0baf4",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A broker's execution structure can influence how prices are sourced, how orders are routed, and how available liquidity interacts with an order.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">La estructura de ejecución de un corredor puede influir en cómo se obtienen los precios, cómo se enrutan las órdenes y cómo interactúa la liquidez disponible con una orden.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t05c5189ba596637b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">That does not mean one execution label guarantees zero slippage.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Eso no significa que una etiqueta de ejecución garantice cero deslizamientos.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5a79465170964a0f",
