      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Registros de ejecución reales</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t943bc3f0de6555c8",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Searching for the “lowest slippage broker” without considering these factors can oversimplify execution quality.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Buscar el \"corredor con menor deslizamiento\" sin considerar estos factores puede simplificar demasiado la calidad de la ejecución.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t792f4f026539ed8e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Can Traders Manage Slippage Risk?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">¿Cómo pueden los comerciantes gestionar el riesgo de deslizamiento?</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta297a3342b47edc0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Slippage cannot be eliminated completely, but traders can make execution choices that reduce exposure to some of the conditions associated with unfavorable fills.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">El deslizamiento no se puede eliminar por completo, pero los operadores pueden tomar decisiones de ejecución que reduzcan la exposición a algunas condiciones asociadas a ejecuciones desfavorables.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t64aaea8d9ad1f11f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">However, this creates a trade-off.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Sin embargo, esto crea una compensación.</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc91e5f31ca83cbe3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The order may remain unfilled if the required price is never available.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-slippage-in-forex-and-cfd-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">La orden puede quedar sin ejecutar si el precio requerido nunca está disponible.</span>"
    }
  ]
}
